    "detailed_description": "Are you ready for the ultimate Pinball challenge? The authentically detailed Pinball tables are inviting you to a round of thrilling arcade action. The modern technology ensures a top-notch, state-of-the-art physics simulation. Marvel at the superb realism, right down to the reflections, on 6 uniquely themed tables with a variety of camera perspectives that deliver the perfect Pinball feeling.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 unique pinball tables: \u201cFly Away\u201d, \u201cRacing\u201d, \u201cIn Space\u201d, \u201cCastle\u201d, \u201cBreak the Speed\u201d, \u201cOktoberfest\u201d<br></li><li>Top-notch simulations of ramps, bumpers and switches<br></li><li>Fantastic pinball physics<br></li><li>Multiple camera angles ensure a totally immersive pinball feeling<br></li><li>Authentic atmosphere right down to realistic reflections and sound effects<br></li><li>Gamepad Support</li></ul>",
